<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's LG Metals daily gold, silver prices.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's LG Metals daily gold, silver prices.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean LG Metals Corp's daily selling prices for gold and silver in the local market:</p>
<p>(won per gram)</p>
<p>		 Jan 30	 Jan 29</p>
<p>    Gold     10,060	 10,120</p>
<p>    Silver	152	    153</p>
<p>(US$ = 863 won)</p>
<p>Note: the company corrected its silver price on January 29 to 153 from 157 it reported earlier.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
